<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on ENI.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on ENI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 25 million American-style warrants, on ENI, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6000 ITL		  ISSUE PRICE   2338 ITL</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	08.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  8090 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
